= Act One: Beginnings

== Scene 3: The River's Warning
+setting: Old Quay
+time: Evening

=== Cel 1: The Tide's Voice
#
The {Burned District} looms, a shadow of its former self.
{Keeper Aldrich} guards the entrance to the {Last Library}.
{Maya Chen} searches for answers among the ruins of the {House}.
At the {Old Quay}, the river murmurs in cadence with the {Last Library - Memory Garden} chimes.

## Treatment - Water, wood, and warding
Barnacled posts groan as the tide turns. A warded lantern sputters, then steadies.

### Narrative - Path forward
{Maya Chen} reads the water's pattern and realizes the sigils point upstream, toward the lockworks.
